WEBVTT

00:01:59.121 --> 00:02:02.371
And I’m in New York’s Schomburg Library

00:02:02.371 --> 00:02:07.246
with my headphones on,
listening to the song:

00:02:07.996 --> 00:02:11.079
"I'm just wild about Harry,

00:02:11.454 --> 00:02:15.038
Harry's wild about me."

00:02:15.079 --> 00:02:16.579
This song,

00:02:16.621 --> 00:02:20.663
this song that I associated
with President Harry Truman,

00:02:20.704 --> 00:02:23.371
who was a white president,

00:02:23.413 --> 00:02:27.204
I had found in a Black music collection

00:02:27.204 --> 00:02:30.829
in a Black library written by
a Black songwriting team